{"id": "800e12f0-06d9-41c8-86ec-c3da970fe95c", "slug": "futuristic-fintech-hero", "title": "Futuristic Fintech Hero", "description": "Futuristic Fintech Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Futuristic Fintech Hero\"\ndescription: \"Futuristic Fintech Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#4ADE80\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#4ADE80\"\n  background: \"#030303\"\n  surface: \"#18181B\"\n  text-primary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  text-secondary: \"#A1A1AA\"\n  border: \"#27272A\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Futuristic Fintech Hero\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourany Phomhome (@sou). Views: 12; favorites: 7; remixes: 1.\nTags: hero, section, animated, cta.\n## Overview\nFuturistic Fintech Feature Section is designed for highlighting product capabilities and value points. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\n');\"> Ethereum 62699 USD +2.01% Solana 145.20 USD +5.12% Bitcoin 68400 USD -0.84% Cardano 0.45 USD +1.10% Ethereum 62699 USD +2.01% Solana 145.20 USD +5.12% Bitcoin 68400 USD -0.84% Cardano 0.45 USD +1.10% Stop guessing…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Stop guessing. Start compounding..\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #4ADE80, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #4ADE80, background #030303, surface #18181B, text-primary #FFFFFF. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nAuthentication and CTA controls should preserve the source button hierarchy, input density, and focused conversion path.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Futuristic Fintech Hero</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/ScrollTrigger.min.js\"></script>\n    <link href=\"https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap\" rel=\"stylesheet\">\n    <script>\n        tailwind.config = {\n            theme: {\n                extend: {\n                    fontFamily: { sans: ['Inter', 'sans-serif'] },\n                    colors: { neon: '#4ade80' }\n                }\n            }\n        }\n    </script>\n</head>\n<body class=\"bg-[#030303] text-white font-sans overflow-x-hidden min-h-screen selection:bg-neon/30 selection:text-white relative\">\n\n    <!-- Global Background Elements -->\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-0\" style=\"background-image: url('data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg width=\\'60\\' height=\\'60\\' xmlns=\\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\'><path d=\\'M0 0h60v60H0z\\' fill=\\'none\\'/><path d=\\'M0 59.5h60M59.5 0v60\\' stroke=\\'rgba(255,255,255,0.015)\\' stroke-width=\\'1\\'/></svg>');\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed top-1/2 left-0 -translate-y-1/2 -translate-x-1/3 w-[60vw] h-[60vw] bg-neon/10 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none z-0 mix-blend-screen opacity-70\"></div>\n    <div class=\"fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none z-50 mix-blend-overlay opacity-30\" style=\"background-image: linear-gradient(transparent 50%, rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4) 50%); background-size: 100% 4px;\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Ticker Bar -->\n    <div class=\"absolute top-0 left-0 w-full overflow-hidden z-40 pointer-events-none pt-4 pb-2\" style=\"mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 10%, black 90%, transparent); -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to right, transparent, black 10%, black 90%, transparent);\">\n        <div class=\"flex items-center w-max ticker-track\">\n            <!-- Ticker Group 1 -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 px-4 ticker-content\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:wallet-money-linear\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\" class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-white/90 font-medium tracking-wide\">Ethereum</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 font-light\">62699 USD</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neon font-medium\">+2.01%</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:card-send-linear\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\" class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-white/90 font-medium tracking-wide\">Solana</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 font-light\">145.20 USD</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neon font-medium\">+5.12%</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\" class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-white/90 font-medium tracking-wide\">Bitcoin</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 font-light\">68400 USD</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-red-400 font-medium\">-0.84%</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pie-chart-2-linear\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\" class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-white/90 font-medium tracking-wide\">Cardano</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 font-light\">0.45 USD</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neon font-medium\">+1.10%</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <!-- Ticker Group 2 (Clone for infinite loop) -->\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-4 px-4 ticker-content\">\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:wallet-money-linear\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\" class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-white/90 font-medium tracking-wide\">Ethereum</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 font-light\">62699 USD</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neon font-medium\">+2.01%</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:card-send-linear\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\" class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-white/90 font-medium tracking-wide\">Solana</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 font-light\">145.20 USD</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neon font-medium\">+5.12%</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:chart-square-linear\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\" class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-white/90 font-medium tracking-wide\">Bitcoin</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 font-light\">68400 USD</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-red-400 font-medium\">-0.84%</span>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"flex items-center gap-3 bg-white/5 border border-white/10 rounded-full px-4 py-1.5 backdrop-blur-md\">\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:pie-chart-2-linear\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\" class=\"text-zinc-400 text-sm\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-white/90 font-medium tracking-wide\">Cardano</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-zinc-500 font-light\">0.45 USD</span>\n                    <span class=\"text-xs text-neon font-medium\">+1.10%</span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Main Content -->\n    <main class=\"min-h-screen w-full flex flex-col lg:flex-row items-center justify-between px-6 lg:px-24 relative z-10 pt-24 lg:pt-0 overflow-hidden\" id=\"hero-main\">\n\n        <!-- Left Side: Content -->\n        <div class=\"w-full lg:w-5/12 flex flex-col justify-center gap-8 relative z-20\">\n            <h1 class=\"text-5xl lg:text-7xl xl:text-[5.5rem] font-semibold tracking-tighter leading-[1.05] text-white drop-shadow-lg\" id=\"headline\">\n                Stop guessing. Start compounding.\n            </h1>\n            <p class=\"text-base lg:text-lg text-zinc-400 font-light leading-relaxed max-w-md opacity-0 translate-y-4\" id=\"subheadline\">\n                Turn volatility into opportunity with systems designed for precision, speed, and controlled execution.\n            </p>\n            <div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-5 pt-4 opacity-0 translate-y-4\" id=\"cta-group\">\n                <button class=\"group relative overflow-hidden rounded-full bg-white/10 backdrop-blur-lg border border-neon/40 px-8 py-3.5 flex items-center gap-2 transition-all duration-300 hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:bg-neon/15 hover:border-neon hover:shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(74,222,128,0.4)]\">\n                    <span class=\"relative z-10 text-neon font-medium tracking-wide text-sm\">Enter platform</span>\n                    <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" style=\"stroke-width: 1.5;\" class=\"relative z-10 text-neon text-lg transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1\"></iconify-icon>\n                    <div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-r from-transparent via-white/10 to-transparent -translate-x-full transition-transform duration-1000 group-hover:translate-x-full\"></div>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"rounded-full px-6 py-3.5 text-zinc-400 font-medium tracking-wide text-sm hover:text-white transition-colors duration-300 border border-transparent hover:border-white/10 hover:bg-white/5\">\n                    Try sandbox\n                </button>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n\n        <!-- Right Side: Visual -->\n        <div class=\"w-full lg:w-7/12 h-[50vh] lg:h-screen relative flex items-center justify-center mt-16 lg:mt-0 right-visual-container\">\n\n            <!-- Repeating Typography Stack -->\n            <div class=\"absolute inset-0 flex flex-col items-center justify-center gap-[-2vh] pointer-events-none mix-blend-screen opacity-90 scale-110 lg:scale-125 select-none w-full\" style=\"transform: rotate(-2deg);\">\n                <div class=\"text-neon text-[7vw] font-semibold leading-[0.8] tracking-tighter whitespace-nowrap typo-layer opacity-10 blur-[8px]\">BUILD &bull; SCALE &bull; WIN</div>\n                <div class=\"text-neon text-[7vw] font-semibold leading-[0.8] tracking-tighter whitespace-nowrap typo-layer opacity-30 blur-[4px]\">BUILD &bull; SCALE &bull; WIN</div>\n                <div class=\"text-neon text-[7vw] font-semibold leading-[0.8] tracking-tighter whitespace-nowrap typo-layer opacity-60 blur-[2px]\">BUILD &bull; SCALE &bull; WIN</div>\n                <div class=\"text-neon text-[7vw] font-semibold leading-[0.8] tracking-tighter whitespace-nowrap typo-layer opacity-100 blur-none drop-shadow-[0_0_20px_rgba(74,222,128,0.6)] z-10\">BUILD &bull; SCALE &bull; WIN</div>\n                <div class=\"text-neon text-[7vw] font-semibold leading-[0.8] tracking-tighter whitespace-nowrap typo-layer opacity-60 blur-[2px]\">BUILD &bull; SCALE &bull; WIN</div>\n                <div class=\"text-neon text-[7vw] font-semibold leading-[0.8] tracking-tighter whitespace-nowrap typo-layer opacity-30 blur-[4px]\">BUILD &bull; SCALE &bull; WIN</div>\n                <div class=\"text-neon text-[7vw] font-semibold leading-[0.8] tracking-tighter whitespace-nowrap typo-layer opacity-10 blur-[8px]\">BUILD &bull; SCALE &bull; WIN</div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- 3D Glass Centerpiece Approximation -->\n            <div class=\"relative z-30 w-64 h-[28rem] lg:w-80 lg:h-[36rem] glass-object-container\" style=\"perspective: 1200px;\">\n                <div class=\"w-full h-full relative glass-object flex flex-col items-center justify-center\" style=\"transform-style: preserve-3d;\">\n\n                    <!-- Top Loop -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-4 w-56 h-56 lg:w-72 lg:h-72 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-gradient-to-br from-white/10 to-transparent backdrop-blur-xl shadow-[inset_0_0_40px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1),0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] flex items-center justify-center mix-blend-hard-light z-20\" style=\"transform: translateZ(40px);\">\n                        <div class=\"w-20 h-20 lg:w-28 lg:h-28 bg-neon rounded-full blur-[24px] opacity-70 energy-core-1 mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n                        <!-- Glass reflection highlight -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute top-2 left-4 w-24 h-12 border-t-[3px] border-l-[3px] border-white/40 rounded-tl-full opacity-50 rotate-[-15deg] blur-[1px]\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Bottom Loop -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute bottom-4 w-56 h-56 lg:w-72 lg:h-72 rounded-full border border-white/20 bg-gradient-to-tr from-white/10 to-transparent backdrop-blur-xl shadow-[inset_0_0_40px_rgba(255,255,255,0.1),0_20px_60px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] flex items-center justify-center mix-blend-hard-light z-10\" style=\"transform: translateZ(-20px);\">\n                        <div class=\"w-20 h-20 lg:w-28 lg:h-28 bg-neon rounded-full blur-[24px] opacity-70 energy-core-2 mix-blend-screen\"></div>\n                        <!-- Glass reflection highlight -->\n                        <div class=\"absolute bottom-2 right-4 w-24 h-12 border-b-[3px] border-r-[3px] border-white/40 rounded-br-full opacity-50 rotate-[-15deg] blur-[1px]\"></div>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <!-- Center connector to imply Figure-8 -->\n                    <div class=\"absolute top-1/2 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 w-40 h-48 lg:w-56 lg:h-64 border-x border-white/10 bg-gradient-to-b from-white/5 via-transparent to-white/5 backdrop-blur-md rounded-[3rem] z-15 mix-blend-overlay\" style=\"transform: translateZ(10px) rotate(10deg);\"></div>\n                </div>\n\n                <!-- Particle Sparks Container -->\n                <div class=\"absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none particle-container z-40\"></div>\n                <!-- Soft reflection on floor -->\n                <div class=\"absolute -bottom-20 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-64 h-12 bg-neon/20 rounded-[100%] blur-[30px] opacity-50 scale-y-50\"></div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </main>\n\n    <script>\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin(ScrollTrigger);\n\n            // --- Masked Word Reveal for Headline ---\n            const headline = document.getElementById('headline');\n            const words = headline.textContent.trim().split(' ');\n            headline.innerHTML = '';\n\n            words.forEach(word => {\n                const wrapper = document.createElement('span');\n                // Use inline styles to avoid messy tailwind arbitary classes for complex pseudo layout\n                wrapper.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                wrapper.style.overflow = 'hidden';\n                wrapper.style.verticalAlign = 'bottom';\n                wrapper.style.marginRight = '0.25em';\n                wrapper.style.paddingBottom = '0.1em';\n\n                const inner = document.createElement('span');\n                inner.className = 'word-inner';\n                inner.style.display = 'inline-block';\n                inner.style.transform = 'translateY(110%) rotate(4deg)';\n                inner.style.transformOrigin = 'top left';\n                inner.textContent = word;\n\n                wrapper.appendChild(inner);\n                headline.appendChild(wrapper);\n                headline.appendChild(document.createTextNode(' '));\n            });\n\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({\n                scrollTrigger: {\n                    trigger: \"#hero-main\",\n                    start: \"top 80%\",\n                }\n            });\n\n            tl.to('.word-inner', {\n                y: '0%',\n                rotation: 0,\n                duration: 1.2,\n                stagger: 0.08,\n                ease: 'power4.out',\n            })\n            .to(['#subheadline', '#cta-group'], {\n                y: 0,\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                ease: 'power3.out'\n            }, \"-=0.8\");\n\n            // --- Ticker Animation ---\n            gsap.to('.ticker-track', {\n                x: '-50%',\n                duration: 35,\n                ease: 'none',\n                repeat: -1\n            });\n\n            // --- Right Side Typography Drift ---\n            gsap.to('.typo-layer', {\n                y: '-2vh',\n                duration: 6,\n                ease: 'sine.inOut',\n                yoyo: true,\n                repeat: -1,\n                stagger: {\n                    each: 0.2,\n                    from: \"center\"\n                }\n            });\n\n            // --- 3D Object Idle Animation ---\n            gsap.to('.glass-object-container', {\n                y: -15,\n                duration: 4,\n                ease: 'sine.inOut',\n                yoyo: true,\n                repeat: -1\n            });\n\n            // --- Internal Energy Cores Movement ---\n            gsap.to('.energy-core-1', {\n                x: 25, y: -15, scale: 1.15,\n                duration: 3.5, ease: 'sine.inOut', yoyo: true, repeat: -1\n            });\n            gsap.to('.energy-core-2', {\n                x: -20, y: 20, scale: 0.9,\n                duration: 4.2, ease: 'sine.inOut', yoyo: true, repeat: -1, delay: 0.5\n            });\n\n            // --- Mouse Hover Interaction for 3D Tilt ---\n            const rightContainer = document.querySelector('.right-visual-container');\n            const glassObj = document.querySelector('.glass-object');\n            const typoLayers = document.querySelectorAll('.typo-layer');\n\n            rightContainer.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {\n                const rect = rightContainer.getBoundingClientRect();\n                const x = (e.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width - 0.5;\n                const y = (e.clientY - rect.top) / rect.height - 0.5;\n\n                // Tilt Object\n                gsap.to(glassObj, {\n                    rotationY: x * 30,\n                    rotationX: -y * 30,\n                    duration: 1.5,\n                    ease: 'power3.out'\n                });\n\n                // Subtle depth shift on typography\n                gsap.to(typoLayers, {\n                    x: (index) => (index - 3) * x * -10,\n                    duration: 1.5,\n                    ease: 'power2.out'\n                });\n            });\n\n            rightContainer.addEventListener('mouseleave', () => {\n                gsap.to(glassObj, { rotationY: 0, rotationX: 0, duration: 2, ease: 'elastic.out(1, 0.5)' });\n                gsap.to(typoLayers, { x: 0, duration: 1.5, ease: 'power2.out' });\n            });\n\n            // --- Particle Generation ---\n            const particleContainer = document.querySelector('.particle-container');\n            for(let i=0; i<15; i++) {\n                let p = document.createElement('div');\n                p.style.position = 'absolute';\n                p.style.width = Math.random() * 3 + 1 + 'px';\n                p.style.height = p.style.width;\n                p.style.backgroundColor = '#4ade80';\n                p.style.borderRadius = '50%';\n                p.style.left = 40 + Math.random() * 20 + '%';\n                p.style.top = 40 + Math.random() * 20 + '%';\n                p.style.opacity = 0;\n                p.style.boxShadow = '0 0 10px #4ade80';\n                particleContainer.appendChild(p);\n\n                function animateParticle() {\n                    gsap.fromTo(p,\n                        { y: 0, opacity: 0, scale: 0 },\n                        {\n                            y: -100 - Math.random() * 150,\n                            x: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 100,\n                            opacity: Math.random() * 0.8 + 0.2,\n                            scale: Math.random() + 0.5,\n                            duration: 2 + Math.random() * 2,\n                            ease: 'power1.out',\n                            onComplete: () => {\n                                gsap.to(p, { opacity: 0, duration: 0.5, onComplete: animateParticle });\n                            }\n                        }\n                    );\n                }\n                setTimeout(animateParticle, Math.random() * 3000);\n            }\n\n            // --- Glitch Flicker (Rare) on background numbers ---\n            // Added subtle glitch to one of the text layers randomly\n            setInterval(() => {\n                if(Math.random() > 0.8) {\n                    const layer = typoLayers[Math.floor(Math.random() * typoLayers.length)];\n                    gsap.to(layer, {\n                        x: () => (Math.random() - 0.5) * 10,\n                        opacity: () => Math.random(),\n                        duration: 0.05,\n                        yoyo: true,\n                        repeat: 3,\n                        onComplete: () => gsap.to(layer, { x: 0, opacity: layer.style.opacity || 1, duration: 0.1 }) // Restore base state smoothly\n                    });\n                }\n            }, 4000);\n        });\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "futuristic-fintech-hero.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/futuristic-fintech-hero.jpg", "source_name": "futuristic-fintech-hero-DESIGN.md", "views": 114, "forks": 4, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "8bd0314a-9525-4a13-996e-2c37cbd9e514", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-02T07:21:38.927703+00:00"}